            "review_text": "IR88\nMelbourne, Australia222 contributions\n0\nDelicious\nJul 2017 • Family\nAbsolutely delicious fresh seafood done Chinese style. Pick your own and from tank to table the food magically appears in no time! The sound of the wok burners were like jet engines which probably explains why! We loved it so much we came twice! If you like seafood and like it fresh this is very worthwhile!\nWritten July 1, 2017",
